Package: pdn-mailcast-headend
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Tom Fanning M0LTE <tom@m0lte.uk>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: pdn-soundmodem
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/packet-net/pdn-mailcast
Description: head end for the daily packet bulletin broadcast
 Takes bulletins from the station's BBS as a forwarding partner and, once a
 day, broadcasts them through the station's own pdn-soundmodem: a transmit
 lease, a calibration tone, then RaptorQ-coded MS110D bursts that receivers
 rebuild and hand to their own BBS. It drives pdn-soundmodem over KISS and its
 HTTP API and never opens the radio itself. Self-contained: it bundles its own
 .NET runtime.
